sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AS as Academic Supervisor
  actor CO as Coordinator
  participant PWA as React PWA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor ST as Student

  AS->>PWA: Enter component scores
  PWA->>API: PUT /grades/{placement}
  API->>DB: Company component = mean rubric score ÷ 5 × 100,<br/>weighted total, status = Draft
  AS->>PWA: Submit grade
  PWA->>API: POST /grades/{p}/submit
  API->>DB: Check: final evaluation submitted, final report<br/>Accepted, every weekly slot Accepted or<br/>Closed as Missing
  alt A condition is not met
    API-->>PWA: 409 Conflict +<br/>list of missing items
  else All conditions met
    API->>DB: Status = Submitted,<br/>audit entry
    API-)CO: Notify "grade waiting<br/>for approval"
  end

  CO->>PWA: Review submitted grade
  alt Approve
    PWA->>API: POST /grades/{p}/approve
    API->>DB: Status = Final (locked),<br/>approved_by / at, audit entry
    API-)ST: Grade now visible<br/>(notification)
  else Return
    PWA->>API: POST /grades/{p}/return<br/>(comment required)
    API->>DB: Status = Draft,<br/>audit entry
    API-)AS: Notify with the comment
  end
  Note over CO,DB: Reopening a Final grade needs a reason and returns it to Draft (FR-WFL-05)
